REPLACE_ME_WITH_YOUR_PUB_KEY_FINGERPRINT
# The 40-char uppercase GPG fingerprint (no spaces) of the key in
# maintainer.pub.asc.  An operator doing out-of-band verification
# copy-pastes THIS string against what they see via `gpg --fingerprint`.
# If the two don't match, do not trust any artifact signed by that key.
#
# Populate with:
#   gpg --fingerprint security@kiln3d.com \
#     | awk '/ = /{gsub(" ",""); print $NF}' \
#     | tr -d '=' \
#     > .well-known/maintainer.pub.sha256
